{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02681","headline":"踏歌词三首 三 · 谢偃","name":"踏歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜久星沈没，更深月影斜。\n裙轻才动佩，鬟薄不胜花。\n细风吹宝袂，轻露湿红纱。\n相看乐未已，兰灯照九华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}